{"id":"63e13a079cbbb17bbd333d813987b906011a943e","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/ai/vE6z6buPMecczPrc.html","title":"Agent 走向具身世界：从语言智能到机器人「大脑指挥官」 | 雷峰网","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"RoboHarness用编排异构策略，让VLA、WAM、RL和TAMP不再各说各话，并零样本完成长时序任务。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"Agent 走向具身世界：从语言智能到机器人「大脑指挥官」\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafN1EyZj75D4ibYg3G2N6t3McOhayAAnaCFHGywKcc2DOjyShdxlmXywk2V9CzcpUIY5yw4hS24khhR3mtXIF0DSuQVmPWlhLan0/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"300\" data-imgfileid=\"100259031\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260826/6a8e833bc3a26.jpg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260826/6a8e833bc3a26.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">RoboHarness用编排异构策略，让VLA、</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">WAM、</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">RL和TAMP不再各说各话，并零样本完成长时序任务。</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-a